    {
      "name": "Vendor Ledger",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Vendor Ledger",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/vendor-ledger/{{vendorId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "vendor-ledger", "{{vendorId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Get the full ledger for a vendor.\n\nReturns: `{ vendor, ledger[], currentBalance }`\n\n**Balance interpretation:**\n- `currentBalance > 0` → You owe the vendor (bills recorded but not fully paid)\n- `currentBalance < 0` → Vendor owes you (advance paid)\n- `currentBalance = 0` → Settled"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Add Vendor Ledger Entry — Credit (Bill Received)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/vendor-ledger",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "vendor-ledger"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"vendorId\": 1,\n  \"amount\": 10000,\n  \"type\": \"Credit\",\n  \"category\": \"Material\",\n  \"remarks\": \"Cement invoice #101\",\n  \"comment\": \"100 bags OPC 53 grade\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "description": "Record a vendor bill/invoice (material received, you now owe the vendor).\n\n**type:** Credit | Debit\n**category:** Material | Payment | Other\n\n**Credit** = vendor sent goods/issued bill → your liability increases\n**Debit** = you paid the vendor → liability decreases"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Add Vendor Ledger Entry — Debit (Payment Made)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/vendor-ledger",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "vendor-ledger"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"vendorId\": 1,\n  \"amount\": 5000,\n  \"type\": \"Debit\",\n  \"category\": \"Payment\",\n  \"remarks\": \"Partial payment against invoice #101\",\n  \"comment\": \"\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "description": "Record a cash payment made to the vendor."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Vendor Ledger Entry",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/vendor-ledger/{{vendorLedgerEntryId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "vendor-ledger", "{{vendorLedgerEntryId}}"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"amount\": 11000,\n  \"remarks\": \"Corrected bill amount\",\n  \"comment\": \"110 bags (was 100)\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "description": "Update a vendor ledger entry. Only `amount`, `remarks`, and `comment` can be changed. Type and category are locked after creation."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Transactions",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List All Transactions",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/transactions?startDate=2025-01-01&endDate=2025-12-31",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "transactions"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "startDate", "value": "2025-01-01", "description": "YYYY-MM-DD (optional)" },
                { "key": "endDate", "value": "2025-12-31", "description": "YYYY-MM-DD (optional)" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Unified real cash flow view across all money movements.\n\nAggregates from 5 sources:\n1. Worker payments made during attendance\n2. Manual ledger debits (cash paid to workers)\n3. Project expenses (excluding auto Labour entries)\n4. Project income\n5. Vendor ledger entries\n\nReturns: `{ entries[], totalOut, totalIn, count }`\n\n**Entry fields:**\n- `type`: worker_payment | manual_ledger | expense | income | vendor\n- `direction`: 'in' | 'out'\n- `label`, `sublabel`, `note`, `category`, `amount`, `date`, `icon`\n\nAll query params are optional. Without dates, returns all transactions."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
